  "audience": "public",
  "q": "Is my data secure?",
  "a": "Yes. Your records are stored under your own company's account and kept separate from every other customer's, and the database enforces that separation on every query. Data is encrypted in transit and at rest, and files sit in private storage that opens only through short-lived links. DeepWell staff have no standing access to your account: your admin can grant **support access** for a set time and revoke it at any time, and every access is recorded in your own activity log.",
